        <updateDate>2025-06-09T19:50:46Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Retirement Fairness for Charities and Educational Institutions Act of 2025</strong><em></em></p><p>This bill allows 403(b) retirement plans (i.e., retirement plans designed for certain employees of public schools, charities, and churches) to invest in collective investment trusts, which are a group of pooled investment assets held by a bank or trust company, and in insurance company separate accounts.</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
